---
pagination:
  data: collections.cityHubs
  size: 1
  alias: hub
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/cities/{{ hub.stateSlug }}/{{ hub.citySlug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Best Tattoo Artists in {{ hub.city }}, {{ hub.stateAbbr }}"
  description: "The best tattoo artists in {{ hub.city }}, {{ hub.stateName }} — reviewed, with their styles, shops and booking info. Find your artist by style and book your next piece."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <p class="page-kicker"><a href="/map/" style="color:var(--gold)">U.S. Map</a> · <a href="/cities/{{ hub.stateSlug }}/" style="color:var(--gold)">{{ hub.stateName }}</a></p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Best Tattoo Artists in <span style="color:var(--gold-bright)">{{ hub.city }}, {{ hub.stateAbbr }}</span></h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">{{ hub.reviews.length }} reviewed artist{{ "s" if hub.reviews.length != 1 }} in {{ hub.city }} — with the styles they're known for.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="feed">
    {%- for item in hub.reviews %}
      {% include "partials/feed-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="prose hub-copy">
    <h2>Finding the right tattoo artist in {{ hub.city }}</h2>
    <p>
      {{ hub.city }} has talent — the trick is matching the <em>right</em> artist to the piece
      you actually want. A traditional specialist and a fine-line specialist are not
      interchangeable, and the difference shows up not on day one but a few years down the line,
      when one tattoo still reads crisp and the other has gone soft. The artist{{ "s" if hub.reviews.length != 1 }}
      featured above {{ "have" if hub.reviews.length != 1 else "has" }} earned the spot in {{ hub.city }}
      on exactly that test: work that holds up.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every review tags the styles an artist specializes in, so you can match the work to what you
      want before you ever send a message. After blackwork or fine-line? Chasing realism, a
      traditional flash piece, or something more specific like psychedelic or patriotic work? Use
      the style tags on each artist, or browse the full <a href="/style/">style index</a> to find
      your match across the country. To see how {{ hub.city }} fits into the bigger picture, open the
      <a href="/cities/{{ hub.stateSlug }}/">{{ hub.stateName }} page</a> or the
      <a href="/map/">interactive U.S. map</a>.
    </p>
    <h3>Booking your tattoo in {{ hub.city }}</h3>
    <p>
      Each artist's review links straight to their Instagram, shop and booking info. Good artists
      book out — sometimes months ahead — so once you've found your match, reach out early, come in
      with a clear idea and some reference, and trust the specialist to make it theirs. That's how
      you walk out with a piece you'll still love in ten years.
    </p>
    <h3>Are you the best in {{ hub.city }}?</h3>
    <p>
      If you think the crown for {{ hub.city }} belongs to you — or to an artist you'd vouch for —
      we want to see the work. <a href="/get-reviewed/">Get reviewed and featured.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/contact-band.njk" %}
